{"seq":2,"slug":"layout-animations","title":"布局动画：FLIP 技术原理与实践","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/web-animation-engineering/advanced/layout-animations","wordCount":812,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"布局动画-flip-技术原理与实践\">布局动画：FLIP 技术原理与实践</h1><p>布局动画是最难实现又最有冲击力的动画类型：当元素在页面上改变位置或尺寸时，使其平滑地从旧状态动画到新状态。直接动画 <code>top</code>/<code>left</code>/<code>width</code>/<code>height</code> 会触发 Layout，性能差。FLIP 技术通过巧妙地将位移测量转换为 <code>transform</code> 动画，解决了这个矛盾。</p>\n<h2 id=\"flip-技术原理\">FLIP 技术原理</h2><p>FLIP 是 First-Last-Invert-Play 四步骤的缩写，由 Paul Lewis 于 2015 年提出：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    A[&quot;1. First&lt;br/&gt;记录元素初始位置&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;2. Last&lt;br/&gt;执行 DOM 变更&lt;br/&gt;记录终态位置&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; C[&quot;3. Invert&lt;br/&gt;用 transform 将元素&lt;br/&gt;反向移回初始位置&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt; D[&quot;4. Play&lt;br/&gt;动画 transform 到 0&lt;br/&gt;视觉上从旧位置移到新位置&quot;]\">graph LR\n    A[\"1. First&lt;br/&gt;记录元素初始位置\"] --&gt; B[\"2. Last&lt;br/&gt;执行 DOM 变更&lt;br/&gt;记录终态位置\"]\n    B --&gt; C[\"3. Invert&lt;br/&gt;用 transform 将元素&lt;br/&gt;反向移回初始位置\"]\n    C --&gt; D[\"4. Play&lt;br/&gt;动画 transform 到 0&lt;br/&gt;视觉上从旧位置移到新位置\"]</pre><p><strong>核心思想</strong>：布局变化后，元素已经在新位置（Last），通过 <code>transform</code> 将其「视觉上」移回旧位置（Invert），再动画将 <code>transform</code> 移除（Play）。因为全程只动画 <code>transform</code>，始终在 compositor 线程上运行。</p>\n<h3 id=\"手动实现-flip\">手动实现 FLIP</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"javascript\" data-code=\"function flipAnimate(element, mutation) {&#10;  // 1. First：记录初始状态&#10;  const first = element.getBoundingClientRect();&#10;&#10;  // 2. Last：执行 DOM 变更&#10;  mutation();&#10;&#10;  // 强制浏览器计算新布局（必须！）&#10;  element.getBoundingClientRect(); // 触发 reflow 读取新位置&#10;&#10;  // 重新读取最终位置&#10;  const last = element.getBoundingClientRect();&#10;&#10;  // 3. Invert：计算位移差，用 transform 反向抵消&#10;  const deltaX = first.left - last.left;&#10;  const deltaY = first.top - last.top;&#10;  const deltaW = first.width / last.width;&#10;  const deltaH = first.height / last.height;&#10;&#10;  element.style.transform = `&#10;    translate(${deltaX}px, ${deltaY}px)&#10;    scale(${deltaW}, ${deltaH})&#10;  `;&#10;  element.style.transformOrigin = &#39;top left&#39;;&#10;&#10;  // 4. Play：动画到无位移状态&#10;  requestAnimationFrame(() =&gt; {&#10;    element.style.transition = &#39;transform 0.4s cubic-bezier(0.2, 0, 0, 1)&#39;;&#10;    element.style.transform = &#39;&#39;;&#10;&#10;    element.addEventListener(&#10;      &#39;transitionend&#39;,&#10;      () =&gt; {&#10;        element.style.transition = &#39;&#39;;&#10;        element.style.transformOrigin = &#39;&#39;;&#10;      },&#10;      { once: true },&#10;    );&#10;  });&#10;}&#10;&#10;// 使用示例：列表排序&#10;const item = document.querySelector(&#39;.list-item&#39;);&#10;flipAnimate(item, () =&gt; {&#10;  // 执行 DOM 重排操作&#10;  list.insertBefore(item, list.firstChild);&#10;});\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> flipAnimate</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">element</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">mutation</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  // 1. First：记录初始状态</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> first</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> element.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">getBoundingClientRect</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  // 2. Last：执行 DOM 变更</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  mutation</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  // 强制浏览器计算新布局（必须！）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  element.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">getBoundingClientRect</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(); </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 触发 reflow 读取新位置</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  // 重新读取最终位置</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> last</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> element.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">getBoundingClientRect</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  // 3. Invert：计算位移差，用 transform 反向抵消</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> deltaX</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> first.left </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> last.left;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> deltaY</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> first.top </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> last.top;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> deltaW</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> first.width </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> last.width;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> deltaH</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> first.height </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> last.height;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  element.style.transform </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> `</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    translate(${</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">deltaX</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">}px, ${</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">deltaY</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">}px)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    scale(${</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">deltaW</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">}, ${</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">deltaH</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">})</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  `</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  element.style.transformOrigin </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'top left'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  // 4. Play：动画到无位移状态</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  requestAnimationFrame</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    element.style.transition </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'transform 0.4s cubic-bezier(0.2, 0, 0, 1)'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    element.style.transform </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> ''</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    element.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">addEventListener</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">      'transitionend'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      () </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        element.style.transition </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> ''</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        element.style.transformOrigin </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> ''</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      { once: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    );</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 使用示例：列表排序</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> item</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> document.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">querySelector</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'.list-item'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">flipAnimate</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(item, () </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  // 执行 DOM 重排操作</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  list.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">insertBefore</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(item, list.firstChild);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">});</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"flip-的尺寸缩放问题\">FLIP 的尺寸缩放问题</h3><p>当元素尺寸变化时（<code>deltaW !== 1</code>），使用 <code>scale</code> 反向抵消会导致文字和子元素也被缩放，看起来模糊。解决方案是对子元素进行反向缩放（counter-scaling）：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"javascript\" data-code=\"const child = element.querySelector(&#39;.content&#39;);&#10;child.style.transform = `scale(${1 / deltaW}, ${1 / deltaH})`;&#10;&#10;// 动画时同步清除&#10;element.style.transition = &#39;transform 0.4s ease&#39;;&#10;child.style.transition = &#39;transform 0.4s ease&#39;;&#10;element.style.transform = &#39;&#39;;&#10;child.style.transform = &#39;&#39;;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> child</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> element.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">querySelector</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'.content'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">child.style.transform </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> `scale(${</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> /</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> deltaW</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">}, ${</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> /</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> deltaH</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">})`</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 动画时同步清除</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">element.style.transition </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'transform 0.4s ease'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">child.style.transition </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'transform 0.4s ease'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">element.style.transform </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> ''</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">child.style.transform </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> ''</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"framer-motion-layout-flip-的声明式封装\">Framer Motion layout：FLIP 的声明式封装</h2><p>Framer Motion 的 <code>layout</code> prop 自动执行 FLIP 计算：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"tsx\" data-code=\"import { motion, AnimatePresence } from &#39;framer-motion&#39;;&#10;import { useState } from &#39;react&#39;;&#10;&#10;function SortableList() {&#10;  const [items, setItems] = useState([&#10;    { id: 1, text: &#39;项目 A&#39; },&#10;    { id: 2, text: &#39;项目 B&#39; },&#10;    { id: 3, text: &#39;项目 C&#39; },&#10;  ]);&#10;&#10;  function moveToTop(id) {&#10;    setItems((prev) =&gt; {&#10;      const item = prev.find((i) =&gt; i.id === id);&#10;      return [item, ...prev.filter((i) =&gt; i.id !== id)];&#10;    });&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  return (&#10;    &lt;ul&gt;&#10;      &lt;AnimatePresence&gt;&#10;        {items.map((item) =&gt; (&#10;          &lt;motion.li&#10;            key={item.id}&#10;            layout // 启用 FLIP 布局动画&#10;            transition={{ type: &#39;spring&#39;, stiffness: 300, damping: 30 }}&#10;            exit={{ opacity: 0, scale: 0.8 }} // 退场动画&#10;            onClick={() =&gt; moveToTop(item.id)}&#10;          &gt;&#10;            {item.text}&#10;          &lt;/motion.li&gt;&#10;        ))}&#10;      &lt;/AnimatePresence&gt;&#10;    &lt;/ul&gt;&#10;  );&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>import { motion, AnimatePresence } from 'framer-motion';</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>import { useState } from 'react';</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>function SortableList() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  const [items, setItems] = useState([</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    { id: 1, text: '项目 A' },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    { id: 2, text: '项目 B' },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    { id: 3, text: '项目 C' },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  ]);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  function moveToTop(id) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    setItems((prev) => {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      const item = prev.find((i) => i.id === id);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      return [item, ...prev.filter((i) => i.id !== id)];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  return (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    &#x3C;ul></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      &#x3C;AnimatePresence></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        {items.map((item) => (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>          &#x3C;motion.li</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            key={item.id}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            layout // 启用 FLIP 布局动画</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            transition={{ type: 'spring', stiffness: 300, damping: 30 }}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            exit={{ opacity: 0, scale: 0.8 }} // 退场动画</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            onClick={() => moveToTop(item.id)}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>          ></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            {item.text}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>          &#x3C;/motion.li></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        ))}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      &#x3C;/AnimatePresence></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    &#x3C;/ul></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  );</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"layoutgroup-协调多组件布局变化\">LayoutGroup 协调多组件布局变化</h3><p>当布局动画跨越多个组件时，需要 <code>LayoutGroup</code> 确保所有组件在同一帧内测量和动画：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"tsx\" data-code=\"import { LayoutGroup, motion } from &#39;framer-motion&#39;;&#10;&#10;function Tabs({ tabs }) {&#10;  const [activeTab, setActiveTab] = useState(tabs[0].id);&#10;&#10;  return (&#10;    &lt;LayoutGroup&gt;&#10;      &lt;div className=&quot;tabs&quot;&gt;&#10;        {tabs.map((tab) =&gt; (&#10;          &lt;button key={tab.id} onClick={() =&gt; setActiveTab(tab.id)}&gt;&#10;            {tab.label}&#10;            {activeTab === tab.id &amp;&amp; (&#10;              &lt;motion.div&#10;                layoutId=&quot;active-indicator&quot; // 跨实例共享同一布局动画&#10;                className=&quot;active-indicator&quot;&#10;                transition={{ type: &#39;spring&#39;, stiffness: 400, damping: 30 }}&#10;              /&gt;&#10;            )}&#10;          &lt;/button&gt;&#10;        ))}&#10;      &lt;/div&gt;&#10;    &lt;/LayoutGroup&gt;&#10;  );&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>import { LayoutGroup, motion } from 'framer-motion';</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>function Tabs({ tabs }) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  const [activeTab, setActiveTab] = useState(tabs[0].id);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  return (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    &#x3C;LayoutGroup></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      &#x3C;div className=\"tabs\"></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        {tabs.map((tab) => (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>          &#x3C;button key={tab.id} onClick={() => setActiveTab(tab.id)}></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            {tab.label}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            {activeTab === tab.id &#x26;&#x26; (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>              &#x3C;motion.div</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                layoutId=\"active-indicator\" // 跨实例共享同一布局动画</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                className=\"active-indicator\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                transition={{ type: 'spring', stiffness: 400, damping: 30 }}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>              /></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            )}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>          &#x3C;/button></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        ))}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      &#x3C;/div></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    &#x3C;/LayoutGroup></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  );</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"autoanimate-零配置布局动画\">AutoAnimate：零配置布局动画</h2><p>对于简单的列表增删场景，<code>@formkit/auto-animate</code> 提供了零配置的布局动画方案：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"tsx\" data-code=\"import { useAutoAnimate } from &#39;@formkit/auto-animate/react&#39;;&#10;&#10;function TodoList({ todos, onRemove }) {&#10;  const [parent] = useAutoAnimate({&#10;    duration: 250,&#10;    easing: &#39;ease-in-out&#39;,&#10;  });&#10;&#10;  return (&#10;    &lt;ul ref={parent}&gt;&#10;      {todos.map((todo) =&gt; (&#10;        &lt;li key={todo.id}&gt;&#10;          {todo.text}&#10;          &lt;button onClick={() =&gt; onRemove(todo.id)}&gt;删除&lt;/button&gt;&#10;        &lt;/li&gt;&#10;      ))}&#10;    &lt;/ul&gt;&#10;  );&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>import { useAutoAnimate } from '@formkit/auto-animate/react';</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>function TodoList({ todos, onRemove }) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  const [parent] = useAutoAnimate({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    duration: 250,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    easing: 'ease-in-out',</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  return (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    &#x3C;ul ref={parent}></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      {todos.map((todo) => (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        &#x3C;li key={todo.id}></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>          {todo.text}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>          &#x3C;button onClick={() => onRemove(todo.id)}>删除&#x3C;/button></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        &#x3C;/li></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      ))}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    &#x3C;/ul></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  );</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>AutoAnimate 在内部使用 WAAPI 的 <code>KeyframeEffect</code>，自动检测子元素的增删和移动，无需手动设置 <code>key</code> 或包装 <code>motion</code> 组件。代价是灵活性较低——无法精确控制每个元素的动画曲线。</p>\n<h2 id=\"布局动画的性能边界\">布局动画的性能边界</h2><p>FLIP 动画的 <strong>Invert 阶段</strong>（读取 <code>getBoundingClientRect()</code>）会触发强制同步布局。在列表长度很大时（&gt;100 项），这个开销不可忽视：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>列表长度</th>\n<th>FLIP 开销（测量阶段）</th>\n<th>建议</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>&lt; 50 项</td>\n<td>可忽略</td>\n<td>直接用 FLIP</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>50-200 项</td>\n<td>约 2-5ms</td>\n<td>评估是否影响帧预算</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&gt; 200 项</td>\n<td>&gt; 10ms，可能 jank</td>\n<td>考虑虚拟列表 + 仅动画可见元素</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>对于超长列表，只对视口内可见的元素执行 FLIP，其余元素直接跳到新位置（无动画）是合理的工程取舍。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>FLIP（First-Last-Invert-Play）</strong>：记录初始位置 → 执行 DOM 变更 → 用 transform 反向补偿位移 → 动画 transform 到 0；全程只动画 transform，始终在 compositor 线程</li>\n<li><strong>getBoundingClientRect()</strong>：FLIP 的 First 和 Last 步骤依赖此 API 读取元素在视口中的绝对位置</li>\n<li><strong>counter-scaling</strong>：当元素尺寸变化时，对子元素应用反向 scale，防止文字和子组件被缩放变形</li>\n<li><strong>LayoutGroup</strong>：Framer Motion 的多组件 layout 动画协调器，确保跨组件的布局变化在同一帧内测量和动画</li>\n<li><strong>layoutId</strong>：Framer Motion 的跨实例共享元素过渡，同一 <code>layoutId</code> 的组件在 DOM 不同位置间自动平滑切换</li>\n<li><strong>AutoAnimate</strong>：零配置布局动画库，自动为父元素的子节点增删和移动添加 WAAPI 动画</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>FLIP 技术是布局动画的核心原理：通过将位移测量转化为 transform 动画，绕过 Layout 触发，在 compositor 线程上运行。Framer Motion 的 <code>layout</code> prop 是这个原理的声明式封装；<code>layoutId</code> 进一步将其扩展到跨组件的共享元素过渡。</p>\n<h2 id=\"本章导航\">本章导航</h2><ul>\n<li>上一篇：<a href=\"scroll-driven-animations\">滚动驱动动画</a> — ScrollTimeline 与 CSS 视差</li>\n<li>下一篇：<a href=\"svg-path-animations\">SVG 路径动画</a> — stroke-dashoffset 与形变动画</li>\n<li>章节概览：<a href=\"../advanced/\">进阶技术</a></li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"布局动画：FLIP 技术原理与实践","id":"布局动画-flip-技术原理与实践"},{"level":2,"text":"FLIP 技术原理","id":"flip-技术原理"},{"level":3,"text":"手动实现 FLIP","id":"手动实现-flip"},{"level":3,"text":"FLIP 的尺寸缩放问题","id":"flip-的尺寸缩放问题"},{"level":2,"text":"Framer Motion layout：FLIP 的声明式封装","id":"framer-motion-layout-flip-的声明式封装"},{"level":3,"text":"LayoutGroup 协调多组件布局变化","id":"layoutgroup-协调多组件布局变化"},{"level":2,"text":"AutoAnimate：零配置布局动画","id":"autoanimate-零配置布局动画"},{"level":2,"text":"布局动画的性能边界","id":"布局动画的性能边界"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"本章导航","id":"本章导航"}],"prev":{"title":"滚动驱动动画：ScrollTimeline、CSS scroll-timeline 与视差效果","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/web-animation-engineering/advanced/scroll-driven-animations"},"next":{"title":"SVG 路径动画：线条绘制、路径形变与 stroke-dashoffset","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/web-animation-engineering/advanced/svg-path-animations"}}